ases are advised to to stay at home.</p><p>Do not expose children to cold. It is preferable to wear thick fabrics like cotton, wool, velvet, etc. It will interest you to know that thick fabrics absorb moisture and keep you warm.</p><p>Wash your eyes regularly to avoid red eyes which is common during harmattan</p><p>Cover your nose and mouth with a mask when it is dusty</p><p>Avoid dust to avoid dust inhalation of harmful particles coming from the wind</p><p>Go to the clinic if you have red, itchy, and watery eyes</p><p>Get medical help if you have a running, itchy, sneezing, and stuffy nose</p><p>Always use moisturizers to prevent dry skin and dry palms</p><p>Use lip balm to prevent cracked lips</p><p>This season can trigger asthma and allergies. Asthmatic patients should always keep the inhaler handy and avoid dust as much as possible. This dry cold dusty season triggers sickle cell disease (SCD) as well.</p>		\n					<h3>Our Mission</h3>				\n		We strive to provide the most reliable and efficient plumbing services, without compromising on quality or safety. We also aim to prove our quality skills, fair prices and customer care, so that we continue our business relationship for many years, beyond the first job we complete.		\n					<h3>Core Values</h3>				\n							<ul>\n							<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256c0 136.967-111.033 248-248 248S8 392.967 8 256 119.033 8 256 8s248 111.033 248 248zM227.314 387.314l184-184c6.248-6.248 6.248-16.379 0-22.627l-22.627-22.627c-6.248-6.249-16.379-6.249-22.628 0L216 308.118l-70.059-70.059c-6.248-6.248-16.379-6.248-22.628 0l-22.627 22.627c-6.248 6.248-6.248 16.379 0 22.627l104 104c6.249 6.249 16.379 6.249 22.628.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										Consider honesty as the key to a business’ trustworthiness and integrity.\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256c0 136.967-111.033 248-248 248S8 392.967 8 256 119.033 8 256 8s248 111.033 248 248zM227.314 387.314l184-184c6.248-6.248 6.248-16.379 0-22.627l-22.627-22.627c-6.248-6.249-16.379-6.249-22.628 0L216 308.118l-70.059-70.059c-6.248-6.248-16.379-6.248-22.628 0l-22.627 22.627c-6.248 6.248-6.248 16.379 0 22.627l104 104c6.249 6.249 16.379 6.249 22.628.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										Always do the right thing to solve the customer’s problem.\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256c0 136.967-111.033 248-248 248S8 392.967 8 256 119.033 8 256 8s248 111.033 248 248zM227.314 387.314l184-184c6.248-6.248 6.248-16.379 0-22.627l-22.627-22.627c-6.248-6.249-16.379-6.249-22.628 0L216 308.118l-70.059-70.059c-6.248-6.248-16.379-6.248-22.628 0l-22.627 22.627c-6.248 6.248-6.248 16.379 0 22.627l104 104c6.249 6.249 16.379 6.249 22.628.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										Perform all work with the highest level of excellence in mind.\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n					<h2>JALSA SALANA 2024 WEATHER FORECAST FOR ILARO AND ADVICE</h2>				\n															<img src=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Weather-Update-qh1mnyzm3sv1nelv75x1dbzivnoan2iz4n1yrb6nsw.webp\" title=\"Weather-Update\" alt=\"Weather-Update\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n		<p>Friday 20 December 2024</p>– Sunrise: 6:29 AM– Sunset: 5:51 PM– Temperature– Day: 37°C– RealFeel®: 36°C– Night: 18°C– RealFeel®: 18°C <p>Saturday 21 December 2024 </p>– Sunrise: 6:29 AM– Sunset: 5:51 PM– Temperature– Day: 37°C– RealFeel®: 36°C– Night: 18°C– RealFeel®: 18°C <p>Sunday 22 December 2024</p>– Sunrise: 6:29 AM– Sunset: 5:51 PM– Temperature– Day: 37°C– RealFeel®: 36°C– Night: 19°C– RealFeel®: 19°CWeather Overview  Partly sunny for all three days at the Jalsa.– Cold at night and early morning for all three days.– Increased cloudiness expected on Saturday.– Sunday will be sunny, with the weather turning cloudy and very warm.<p>Advice for Jalsa Participants:</p><p>1. Bring sweaters for the cold weather.<br />2. Participants with allergies should be cautious of dust; consider wearing a nose mask.<br />3. Bring mosquito nets for protection against indoor and outdoor pests.<br />4. Consider bringing a blanket for added warmth during the cold nights.</p>		\n						<i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i> 5/5		\n							Sed ut pers piciatis unde omnis iste natus error sit volup tatem accus antium dolore mque laudan tium, totam rem aperiam, eaque ipsa quae ab illo inventore.\n							<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/customer-1-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														Martin Foster\n						<i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i> 5/5		\n							Sed ut pers piciatis unde omnis iste natus error sit volup tatem accus antium dolore mque laudan tium, totam rem aperiam, eaque ipsa quae ab illo inventore.\n							<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/customer-4-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														Bryan Cirius\n						<i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i> 5/5		\n							Sed ut pers piciatis unde omnis iste natus error sit volup tatem accus antium dolore mque laudan tium, totam rem aperiam, eaque ipsa quae ab illo inventore.\n							<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/customer-3-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														Jane Dowser\n						<i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i> 5/5		\n							Sed ut pers piciatis unde omnis iste natus error sit volup tatem accus antium dolore mque laudan tium, totam rem aperiam, eaque ipsa quae ab illo inventore.\n							<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/customer-1-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														Martin Foster\n						<i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i> 5/5		\n							Sed ut pers piciatis unde omnis iste natus error sit volup tatem accus antium dolore mque laudan tium, totam rem aperiam, eaque ipsa quae ab illo inventore.\n							<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/customer-4-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														Bryan Cirius\n						<i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i> 5/5		\n							Sed ut pers piciatis unde omnis iste natus error sit volup tatem accus antium dolore mque laudan tium, totam rem aperiam, eaque ipsa quae ab illo inventore.\n							<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/customer-3-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														Jane Dowser\n															<img src=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/images.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h2>OPENNESS AND\nTRANSPARENCY</h2>				\n		<p>Our mosques remain open for all, to help breakdown barriers and build trust, integration and cohesion by enabling a better understanding of Islamic beliefs and their role in modern life.</p><p>We organise regular peace symposiums and run a free to view satellite channel MTA International (available on Sky 787) dedicated to spreading harmony among and between all people regardless of faith and background, further underlining our openness as a community that promotes integration based on mutual respect.</p>		\n					<a href=\"#\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z\"></path></svg>			\n									+234 802 376 5263\n					</a>','','https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/360_F_335870116_0ODNCQ3eRXwiIXCEFDQ6mKrKWCid8uay.jpg','PAGE',NULL,'2026-11-14 11:34:39.073','2026-11-14 11:34:39.073'),('cmwgbw54p00ci6gaho67s20xt',1791,'jalsasalana.ng','page','Programme of Events - Jalsa Salana Nigeria 2024','programme-of-events-jalsa-salana-nigeria-2024','2024-01-01 10:00:00.000','https://jalsasalana.ng/?page_id=1791','<h1>70th Jalsa Salana Nigeria</h1><p><b>70th Annual Convention - Platinum Jubilee</b>  |  \n20th – 22nd December 2024. Ilaro, Ogun State</p>		\n					<a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/3d-flip-book/programme-of-event-jalsa-salana-nigeria-2024/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z\"></path></svg>			\n									Programme of Event\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"887\" height=\"766\" src=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/jalsa24.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/jalsa24.png 887w, https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/jalsa24-300x259.png 300w, https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/jalsa24-768x663.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 887px) 100vw, 887px\" />													\n			<h5>About the Jalsa Salana</h5>		\n			<h2>The Jalsa Salana is the annual 3-days general meeting of the Ahmadiyya Muslim Jamaat Nigeria.</h2>		\n		<p>With over 40,000 visitors, it is the largest regular gathering of Muslims in Nigeria. The history of the Jalsa Salana dates back to after 1891 when the founder of the reform movement, Hazrat Mirza Ghulam Ahmad Qadiani (as) first proclaimed the Jalsa Salana in Qadian (India). At that time, 75 members of the congregation attended. Since then, the Jalsa Salana has become firmly established in many countries around the world. For example, over 200,000 visitors attended the last Jalsa Salana in Pakistan, in 1983.</p>		\n					<a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/ahmadiyya/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z\"></path></svg>			\n									Know More About Us\n					</a>\n			<h2>Objectives, Purpose &amp; <br>Blessings of Jalsa Salana</h2>		\n		<p>The primary purpose of this Convention is to enable every sincere individual to personally experience religious benefits; They may enhance their knowledge and – due to their being blessed and enabled by Allah, The Exalted – their perception [of Allah] may progress. Among its secondary benefits is that this congregational meeting together will promote mutual introduction among all brothers, and it will strengthen the fraternal ties within this Community.“</p>		\n					<a href=\"#\">\n									Hadhrat Mirza Ghulam Ahmad Qadiani (as), (Ishtihar 7 Dec. 1892, Majmoo`ah Ishtiharat Vol. I, Page 340)\n					</a>\n													<img src=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/321565323_5790593367670753_8475051458437577127_n-qh0hw8y1pofq3yudmaayrlnr19ck4gedh37h72nf60.jpg\" title=\"321565323_5790593367670753_8475051458437577127_n\" alt=\"321565323_5790593367670753_8475051458437577127_n\" loading=\"lazy\" />													\n		[3d-flip-book id=\"2145\" ][/3d-flip-book]		\n			<h2>Jalsa Salana 2024</h2>		\n														<a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/news/\">\n							<img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/321338844_563381655232570_8212325114854241156_n-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/321338844_563381655232570_8212325114854241156_n-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/321338844_563381655232570_8212325114854241156_n-300x200.jpg 300w, https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/321338844_563381655232570_8212325114854241156_n-768x512.jpg 768w, https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/321338844_563381655232570_8212325114854241156_n.jpg 1440w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />								</a>\n			<h4><a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/news/\">Information</a></h4>		\n		<p>Are you looking for information about the Jalsa? Follow this link.</p>		\n														<a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/JALSA-PROGRAMME-1.pdf\">\n							<img width=\"887\" height=\"766\" src=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/jalsa24.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/jalsa24.png 887w, https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/jalsa24-300x259.png 300w, https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/jalsa24-768x663.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 887px) 100vw, 887px\" />								</a>\n			<h4><a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/jalsa-salana-nigreria-platinum-jubilee\">Program of the Jalsa Salana 2024</a></h4>		\n		<p>Click here for details about the Jalsa Salana program.</p>		\n														<a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/transportation/\">\n							<img src=\"https://www.alhakam.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/IMG_20210713_131608_042.jpg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />								</a>\n			<h4><a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/transportation/\">Transportation</a></h4>		\n		<p>Need information about Transportation at Jalsa? Click here for more details.</p>		\n														<a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/accommodation/\">\n							<img src=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/cf446055-8c01-4541-9d43-a6f170f6db9b.jpeg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />								</a>\n			<h4><a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/accommodation/\">Accomodation</a></h4>		\n		<p>Several hotels around Jalsa Gah are providing a discounted hotel rate to Jalsa guests. Please click here for the full and updated hotel list.</p>		\n														<a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/news/\">\n							<img width=\"1024\" height=\"682\" src=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18402a66-257e-4945-8d4f-d1245c47e563-1024x682.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18402a66-257e-4945-8d4f-d1245c47e563-1024x682.jpeg 1024w, https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18402a66-257e-4945-8d4f-d1245c47e563-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18402a66-257e-4945-8d4f-d1245c47e563-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18402a66-257e-4945-8d4f-d1245c47e563.jpeg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />								</a>\n			<h4><a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/news/\">Special Events</a></h4>		\n		<p>More information for our international guests is at this link.</p>		\n														<a href=\"https://jalsa.ahmadiyyanigeria.net\">\n							<img src=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/WhatsApp-Image-2024-11-24-at-11.15.17.jpeg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />								</a>\n			<h4><a href=\"https://jalsa.ahmadiyyanigeria.net\">Registration</a></h4>		\n		<p>Click here for Registering for Jalsa Salana.</p>		\n					<a href=\"#\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z\"></path></svg>			\n									View All Services\n					</a>','<h1>70th Jalsa Salana Nigeria</h1><p><b>70th Annual Convention - Platinum Jubilee</b>  |  \n20th – 22nd December 2024. Ilaro, Ogun State</p>		\n					<a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/3d-flip-book/programme-of-event-jalsa-salana-nigeria-2024/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z\"></path></svg>			\n									Programme of Event\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"887\" height=\"766\" src=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/jalsa24.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/jalsa24.png 887w, https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/jalsa24-300x259.png 300w, https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/jalsa24-768x663.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 887px) 100vw, 887px\" />													\n			<h5>About the Jalsa Salana</h5>		\n			<h2>The Jalsa Salana is the annual 3-days general meeting of the Ahmadiyya Muslim Jamaat Nigeria.</h2>		\n		<p>With over 40,000 visitors, it is the largest regular gathering of Muslims in Nigeria. The history of the Jalsa Salana dates back to after 1891 when the founder of the reform movement, Hazrat Mirza Ghulam Ahmad Qadiani (as) first proclaimed the Jalsa Salana in Qadian (India). At that time, 75 members of the congregation attended. Since then, the Jalsa Salana has become firmly established in many countries around the world. For example, over 200,000 visitors attended the last Jalsa Salana in Pakistan, in 1983.</p>		\n					<a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/ahmadiyya/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z\"></path></svg>			\n									Know More About Us\n					</a>\n			<h2>Objectives, Purpose &amp; <br>Blessings of Jalsa Salana</h2>		\n		<p>The primary purpose of this Convention is to enable every sincere individual to personally experience religious benefits; They may enhance their knowledge and – due to their being blessed and enabled by Allah, The Exalted – their perception [of Allah] may progress. Among its secondary benefits is that this congregational meeting together will promote mutual introduction among all brothers, and it will strengthen the fraternal ties within this Community.“</p>		\n					<a href=\"#\">\n									Hadhrat Mirza Ghulam Ahmad Qadiani (as), (Ishtihar 7 Dec. 1892, Majmoo`ah Ishtiharat Vol. I, Page 340)\n					</a>\n													<img src=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/321565323_5790593367670753_8475051458437577127_n-qh0hw8y1pofq3yudmaayrlnr19ck4gedh37h72nf60.jpg\" title=\"321565323_5790593367670753_8475051458437577127_n\" alt=\"321565323_5790593367670753_8475051458437577127_n\" loading=\"lazy\" />													\n		[3d-flip-book id=\"2145\" ][/3d-flip-book]		\n			<h2>Jalsa Salana 2024</h2>		\n														<a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/news/\">\n							<img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/321338844_563381655232570_8212325114854241156_n-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/321338844_563381655232570_8212325114854241156_n-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/321338844_563381655232570_8212325114854241156_n-300x200.jpg 300w, https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/321338844_563381655232570_8212325114854241156_n-768x512.jpg 768w, https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/321338844_563381655232570_8212325114854241156_n.jpg 1440w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />								</a>\n			<h4><a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/news/\">Information</a></h4>		\n		<p>Are you looking for information about the Jalsa? Follow this link.</p>		\n														<a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/JALSA-PROGRAMME-1.pdf\">\n							<img width=\"887\" height=\"766\" src=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/jalsa24.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/jalsa24.png 887w, https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/jalsa24-300x259.png 300w, https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/jalsa24-768x663.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 887px) 100vw, 887px\" />								</a>\n			<h4><a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/jalsa-salana-nigreria-platinum-jubilee\">Program of the Jalsa Salana 2024</a></h4>		\n		<p>Click here for details about the Jalsa Salana program.</p>		\n														<a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/transportation/\">\n							<img src=\"https://www.alhakam.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/IMG_20210713_131608_042.jpg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />								</a>\n			<h4><a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/transportation/\">Transportation</a></h4>		\n		<p>Need information about Transportation at Jalsa? Click here for more details.</p>		\n														<a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/accommodation/\">\n							<img src=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/cf446055-8c01-4541-9d43-a6f170f6db9b.jpeg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />								</a>\n			<h4><a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/accommodation/\">Accomodation</a></h4>		\n		<p>Several hotels around Jalsa Gah are providing a discounted hotel rate to Jalsa guests. Please click here for the full and updated hotel list.</p>		\n														<a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/news/\">\n							<img width=\"1024\" height=\"682\" src=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18402a66-257e-4945-8d4f-d1245c47e563-1024x682.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18402a66-257e-4945-8d4f-d1245c47e563-1024x682.jpeg 1024w, https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18402a66-257e-4945-8d4f-d1245c47e563-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18402a66-257e-4945-8d4f-d1245c47e563-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18402a66-257e-4945-8d4f-d1245c47e563.jpeg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />								</a>\n			<h4><a href=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/news/\">Special Events</a></h4>		\n		<p>More information for our international guests is at this link.</p>		\n														<a href=\"https://jalsa.ahmadiyyanigeria.net\">\n							<img src=\"https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/WhatsApp-Image-2024-11-24-at-11.15.17.jpeg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />								</a>\n			<h4><a href=\"https://jalsa.ahmadiyyanigeria.net\">Registration</a></h4>		\n		<p>Click here for Registering for Jalsa Salana.</p>		\n					<a href=\"#\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z\"></path></svg>			\n									View All Services\n					</a>','','https://jalsasalana.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/jalsa24.png','PAGE',NULL,'2026-11-14 11:34:39.097','2026-11-14 11:34:39.097'),('cmwgbw59400d16gah1480vly1',1932,'jalsasalana.ng','page','Accommodation','accommodation','2024-01-01 10:00:00.000','https://jalsasalana.ng/?page_id=1932','The accommodation department plays a crucial role in ensuring a seamless and comfortable experience for attendees. This department is responsible for managing lodging arrangements and addressing the diverse needs of participants. Thus, it serves as a central point of contact for attendees, and managing check-in of guests.\r\n\r\nThe department is responsible for coordinating with designated lodging facilities within and outside the main venue to secure a sufficient number of rooms for all attendees. It also ensures that all lodging facilities cater to specific important requirements like prayer spaces, convenience units and special lodging for the elderly, in order to enhance the overall experiences and specific needs of all categories of attendees. This attention to detail reflects the community\'s commitment to providing a supportive environment for its members.\r\n\r\nMoreover, the team collaborates with other departments to synchronize schedules, aligning accommodation logistics with the overall event programme. This coordination helps prevent scheduling conflicts and ensures that participants can seamlessly transition between accommodation and convention activities.\r\n\r\nIn essence, the accommodation department plays a pivotal role in creating a hospitable environment, where the practical needs of attendees are met, allowing them to focus on the spiritual and communal aspects of the convention.','The accommodation department plays a crucial role in ensuring a seamless and comfortable experience for attendees. This department is responsible for managing lodging arrangements and addressing the diverse needs of participants. Thus, it serves as a central point of contact for attendees, and managing check-in of guests.\r\n\r\nThe department is responsible for coordinating with designated lodging facilities within and outside the main venue to secure a sufficient number of rooms for all attendees. It also ensures that all lodging facilities cater to specific important requirements like prayer spaces, convenience units and special lodging for the elderly, in order to enhance the overall experiences and specific needs of all categories of attendees. This attention to detail reflects the community\'s commitment to providing a supportive environment for its members.\r\n\r\nMoreover, the team collaborates with other departments to synchronize schedules, aligning accommodation logistics with the overall event programme. This coordination helps prevent scheduling conflicts and ensures that participants can seamlessly transition between accommodation and convention activities.\r\n\r\nIn essence, the accommodation department plays a pivotal role in creating a hospitable environment, where the practical needs of attendees are met, allowing them to focus on the spiritual and communal aspects of the convention.','',NULL,'PAGE',NULL,'2026-11-14 11:34:39.256','2026-11-14 11:34:39.256'),('cmwgbw59d00d26gaher5hv3z3',1940,'jalsasalana.ng','page','Transportation','transportation','2024-01-01 10:00:00.000','https://jalsasalana.ng/?page_id=1940','The transportation department is instrumental in facilitating the smooth movement of attendees, ensuring efficient travel to and from the event venue. This department undertakes several key functions to optimize transportation logistics and providing travel guide.\r\n\r\nFirst and foremost, the transportation team handles the various transportation facilities of the community and effectively manages vehicular movements to ensure free flow of traffic and ease mobility in and outside the venue. It plans routes, schedule pick-up and drop-off points, and manage transportation resources to accommodate the diverse needs of participants.\r\n\r\nThe transportation team works closely with the accommodation department to synchronize schedules, aligning pick-up and drop-off times with check-in and check-out processes, especially for guests.. This collaborative effort aims to minimize wait times, streamline logistics, and create a seamless experience for convention participants.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, the department plays a vital role in managing traffic flow and parking logistics around the event venue. By implementing well-thought-out plans, they contribute to a hassle-free arrival and departure experience, minimizing congestion and ensuring the safety of all attendees.\r\n\r\nIn summary, the transportation department is integral to the overall success of the convention. Their meticulous planning and coordination efforts enable attendees to focus on the purpose of the event, fostering a sense of unity and shared experience among all participants.','The transportation department is instrumental in facilitating the smooth movement of attendees, ensuring efficient travel to and from the event venue. This department undertakes several key functions to optimize transportation logistics and providing travel guide.\r\n\r\nFirst and foremost, the transportation team handles the various transportation facilities of the community and effectively manages vehicular movements to ensure free flow of traffic and ease mobility in and outside the venue. It plans routes, schedule pick-up and drop-off points, and manage transportation resources to accommodate the diverse needs of participants.\r\n\r\nThe transportation team works closely with the accommodation department to synchronize schedules, aligning pick-up and drop-off times with check-in and check-out processes, especially for guests.. This collaborative effort aims to minimize wait times, streamline logistics, and create a seamless experience for convention participants.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, the department plays a vital role in managing traffic flow and parking logistics around the event venue. By implementing well-thought-out plans, they contribute to a hassle-free arrival and departure experience, minimizing congestion and ensuring the safety of all attendees.\r\n\r\nIn summary, the transportation department is integral to the overall success of the convention. Their meticulous planning and coordination efforts enable attendees to focus on the purpose of the event, fostering a sense of unity and shared experience among all participants.','',NULL,'PAGE',NULL,'2026-11-14 11:34:39.265','2026-11-14 11:34:39.265');
